<title>USA: CENTRAL U.S. CARLOT PORK AT 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL U.S. CARLOT PORK AT 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Friday's 3:00 PM close, fresh loins were unevenly steady; butts steady to 2.00 higher in very light test; sknd. hams generally steady; sdls. bellies 3.00 lower in a light test; lean trimmings steady. Trading slow, with light demand and light to moderate offerings. -- USDA Market News.</p>
<p>NOTE: 0.5 ld. of 4-8# butts traded at $83.00.</p>
